From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8188fu: port the driver to Linux 7.3

Adapt the Realtek driver to the 7.3 kernel API: cfg80211
wireless_dev ops, timer renames, strscpy/strncpy, NAPI,
GRO, PDE_DATA, kthread completion, random, USB driver
embedding, and the ROC/mgmt-tx cookie ABI. Disable the
bridge extension, which needs the removed AppleTalk and
PPPoE wire structures.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
